{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaaty/mobile_since

    The line that says when what the app shows was made (local\freshness), for a page that is no longer recent: without a
    connection, when the site does not answer, or in an app left open. The app evaluates «hidden» with the phone's clock;
    an app without that clock keeps the line hidden.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * due - From when the line shows, a timestamp.
    * text - The line: the day and the time, never relative.
    * refresh - The label of the button that asks for the page again; hidden without a connection.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "due": 1764000000,
        "text": "Así estaba el martes 24 de noviembre, 9:12. Puede haber cambiado.",
        "refresh": "Actualizar"
    }
}}
<div class="aty-desde" [hidden]="!(CoreTime?.timestamp?.() >= {{due}})">
    <ion-icon name="fas-clock-rotate-left" aria-hidden="true"></ion-icon>
    <p class="aty-desde-texto">{{text}}</p>
    <button type="button" class="aty-ver aty-desde-otra" (click)="refreshContent?.(true)">{{refresh}}</button>
</div>
